@startuml fig7b_artifact_provenance
!include style.iuml
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 70

class "Entity" as Entity <<PROV-O>> #EDEDED
class InformationArtifact
class Answer
class ExecutionTrace
class Invocation #EDEDED

Entity <|-- InformationArtifact
Answer -up-> InformationArtifact : prov:wasDerivedFrom
InformationArtifact <|-- ExecutionTrace
InformationArtifact --> Invocation : prov:wasGeneratedBy
Invocation --> InformationArtifact : prov:used
ExecutionTrace --> Invocation : records
@enduml
